  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>困ったなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is a problem...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何か困ってることが
あんなら、助けるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you're struggling with anything,
we've got you covered.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや……ですが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No... Well...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>話してください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please, speak.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは！　頭領……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh! Clan head!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実は、私の相棒が、
仕事の途中にケガを
しまして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The truth is, my partner
was injured in the course
of his work...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ケガを……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Injured...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その仕事というのは？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And what was his work?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とある連中の悪事の現場を、
屋敷に忍び込み、
抑えてくることなのですが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He was to infiltrate a mansion, the site
of operations of a certain group of
villains, and seize a certain something...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は私でそれにかかわる、
別の仕事をしなければ
なりません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I had different, but closely
related work, which I also
needed to pursue.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こちらも急ぎ、
ですが、そちらも急ぎ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Both of our jobs
were time-sensitive.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ですからふたりで
動いていたのですが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Therefore, we took
action together, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その相棒がケガをされた、
ということなのですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As you said, your
partner was injured.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは、
オレたちの出番かもな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sounds like this might
be a job for us...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、困った困った……
相棒が任務でケガして
しまった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, this is really bad...
My partner was injured
in the line of duty...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……このままでは、私も
動けない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Under these circmustances,
I can't take action, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やはり、この仕事は忍びの
能力を持つものでないと、
勤まりませぬな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Unfortunately, this is work
suited only for those trained
in the arts of the shinobi...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーむ……
このままでは仕事が進められない……
誰かの手を借りられないものか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... I can't finish my work
like this... I might need to
ask for someone's help...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、オレが
手伝ってやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, I'll take care of it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そいつらの
悪事の証拠ってのを
押さえてくればいいんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm guessing I just need
to seize some evidence
of what they're up to?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレだって、
なりきり士なんだから、
忍者にくらいなれるぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, I'm a Roleplayer.
I can do ninja work,
no problem at all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃん、
手伝わせてくれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let me cover
for him, &lt;Suzu&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかりました。
お願いします</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Okay, I understand.
Then, please do.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、こんな……
よろしいのでしょうか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But well, that's...
Are you certain...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ。&lt;Dio&gt;さんなら、
ちゃんと仕事をしてくれると
思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Indeed. &lt;Dio&gt; should
be able to complete
the work admirably.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、ですか。
では……説明を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see... Well, then I'll
explain the details...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、オレが
手伝ってやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, I'll take care of it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まぁ、任せとけって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, just leave it to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいのでしょうか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you sure...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……はぁ、まぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Uhm, probably...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうですか……
では、説明を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see... Well, then I'll
explain the details...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さすがにこの仕事は、
わたしたちにはムリだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm pretty sure we're not
up to work like this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きみたちも忍者になれれば、
いいんだけどね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you could become ninja,
you should be able to do it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
